Match User bird-tunnel
    AuthenticationMethods publickey
    PasswordAuthentication no
    AllowTcpForwarding remote
    PermitListen 127.0.0.1:18000
    GatewayPorts no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
    PermitTTY no
    MaxSessions 0
Match all
